<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Dodo billing patterns</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href={~p"/assets/app.css"} />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="shell pattern-shell">
      <a class="secondary-link" href={~p"/"}>← One-time checkout</a>
      <p class="eyebrow">Runnable Phoenix field guide</p>
      <h1>Ten billing patterns, one reliability model.</h1>
      <p class="description pattern-intro">
        Each card is a small vertical slice. Demo actions write only to the local SQLite
        inbox, outbox, projections, or usage buckets; Dodo calls remain explicit and
        dispatchable through the SDK.
      </p>

      <section class="pattern-grid">
        <a :for={pattern <- @patterns} class="pattern-card" href={~p"/patterns/#{pattern.slug}"}>
          <span class="pattern-number">{pattern.id}</span>
          <div>
            <h2>{pattern.title}</h2>
            <p>{pattern.use_case}</p>
          </div>
        </a>
      </section>

      <section class="state-strip">
        <div><strong>{length(@records)}</strong><span>local projections</span></div>
        <div><strong>{length(@commands)}</strong><span>pending commands</span></div>
        <div><strong>{length(@buckets)}</strong><span>usage buckets</span></div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
